{"id":"n15859-2-7","stage":3,"title":"발걸음 · 来往","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15859-2-7-1","ko":"얼마 전부터 가게에 손님들의 발걸음이 뜸해서 걱정이야.","zh":"最近店里的顾客越来越少，我好担心啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전부터","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게에","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님들의","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발걸음이","meaning":"来往","explanation":"발걸음：来往；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"발걸음","audio":"/audio/908aa31e6321f7c4f744.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15859","senseId":"2","lemma":"발걸음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜸해서","meaning":"消停，稀少，稀疏","explanation":"뜸하다：消停，稀少，稀疏；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"뜸하다","audio":"/audio/d7db5e4a7f8ac9a9c6fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54144","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜸하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걱정이야.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"未确定的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"比一定时期早。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"908aa31e6321f7c4","term":"발걸음","zh":"来往","audio":"/audio/908aa31e6321f7c4f744.mp3","entryId":"15859","definition":"来和去的行为。","pronunciation":["발꺼름"]},{"id":"d7db5e4a7f8ac9a9","term":"뜸하다","zh":"消停，稀少，稀疏","audio":"/audio/d7db5e4a7f8ac9a9c6fc.mp3","entryId":"54144","definition":"经常往来的人或常见的东西一段时间内变少或几乎没有。","pronunciation":["뜸ː하다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbfa3fb477abbf9632f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15859-2-7-2","ko":"요즘 불경기여서 다른 가게들도 손님이 줄었대.","zh":"因为现在经济不景气，据说其他店铺的顾客也减少了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불경기여서","meaning":"不景气，萧条","explanation":"불경기：不景气，萧条；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；여서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"불경기","audio":"/audio/4ca8453f5b02ba231a4e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60369","senseId":"1","lemma":"불경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게들도","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님이","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄었대.","meaning":"减少","explanation":"줄다：减少；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"줄다","audio":"/audio/4a79f5ac1f29eb5f4299.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82138","senseId":"2","lemma":"줄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"4ca8453f5b02ba23","term":"불경기","zh":"不景气，萧条","audio":"/audio/4ca8453f5b02ba231a4e.mp3","entryId":"60369","definition":"社会经济活动不活跃，物价与工资下降，生产萎缩，失业率上升的状态。","pronunciation":["불경기"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"4a79f5ac1f29eb5f","term":"줄다","zh":"减少","audio":"/audio/4a79f5ac1f29eb5f4299.mp3","entryId":"82138","definition":"数或量变得比原来少。","pronunciation":["줄ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d4441d4f6d2120e1d69.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.862,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=1